      "",
      "## 3. Chatbot and Automation Strategies",
      "",
      "Manually responding is not scalable. Here are automation levels:",
      "",
      "## Level 1: Basic Automation (Rule-Based)",
      "",
      "Automatic response to certain keywords:",
