      "",
      "Appointment Reminder:",
      "'{{1}}, reminder for your appointment on {{2}}. Cancel/change: {{3}}'",
      "",
      "## 5. Integration and API Usage",
      "",
      "To integrate WhatsApp Business API with your existing systems:",
      "",
      "## CRM Integration:",
      "",
      "Salesforce integration example:",
      "",
      "Webhook -> Salesforce Flow -> Update customer record -> Send automatic response",
      "",
      "## E-Commerce Integration:",
      "",
      "For Shopify/WooCommerce:",
      "",
      "- Cart abandonment notification (after 1 hour)",
      "- Order confirmation and tracking",
      "- Stock alerts (when favorite product is back in stock)",
      "- Review request (3 days after delivery)",
      "",
      "## 6. Performance Measurement and Optimization",
      "",
